{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个动了心、又很怕自己成为对方负担的人，在一次次亲近中既感到幸福，又不断担心对方会不会有一天不再需要自己。最后，他决定不再隐藏喜欢，也不再强求永远，只想珍惜眼前的相处，继续陪在对方身边。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却怕打扰\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近甜蜜又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"想告白却说不出口\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕为难对方\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"被看见后又怕太黏\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"对方如常才安心\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"觉得自己也被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近时敢回应\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕有天不再被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"决定先享受当下\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再藏喜欢仍愿陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"尽情付出不问回报\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想要永远却知不可求\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"不求永远仍坦白喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06–S09，情绪在安心、孤独、觉得被需要和害怕失去之间反复转折，需要一点时间才能理清。最抓人的是 S02 的亲近感、S05–S06 的患得患失，以及 S12–S14 从情感涌出到接受不确定未来的收束，能感觉到人物确实发生了变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2c57cb52-3e00-4c04-a6b5-d72ec5fdd836", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T192913091738Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.11, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:29:54.209355+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7f35d4916cd208f32713ee2f27d5aa30ffe46f2be7d8426071d4419b1fee15b8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T192913091738Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b6c0a68c9034a37546228cb25e19af370bd3c212b81ae976773fd227ebd897f9"}}}
